# BrandGuard AI Frontend Environment Configuration
#
# VITE_API_URL:
# - By default, the frontend automatically resolves the backend address using the current
#   browser hostname (window.location.hostname:5000/api). This enables seamless multi-laptop
#   LAN access without changing code or configs.
# - You can also configure it explicitly:
#     Local access only:  http://localhost:5000/api
#     LAN access:         http://<HOST_LAN_IP>:5000/api (e.g., http://192.168.1.6:5000/api)
VITE_API_URL=/api
